        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjooga neajeedeesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sing'eachi giidiing'noodeaba geat gicha? Ghana sigasayi gidagasiida buuneeda suurja barawajeega gwarsiinda jea ghapka heedeang'wa, ghana gwaleabu heedeang'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga goowooschi barawajeandeanya bea gwarsiinda, sing'oorsa jeesinga gurooruunatkeagwa, biissa ea nalaat nea ghoasoamwa buuneesean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoahiimu gideaba goowooschi barawajeanda leabu heeda Gristo sigooneasa aseasa, meang'waarana galaamu geang'waara Guroorooda ASEETA majeek, ak ea mii badahuuka lagheanga gil geeng'oorsa badahuuka gurooruunatka hang'oonyi bea buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geendeawi masaweega aba madeeda ASEETA aba naweeda Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii gideaba geahiichi geat aseasa gil aba giipkeata ng'asheanda wassean gideaba gwaleabu heedeanya aseasa; hidoodeanyu gwaleabu heeda ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba niny dea nung' eamuusa eahuuwa fuga gadiyeesa neajeedeesh, meeng'oorsiina jeeda barawajeanda geang'waar aba jeeda Guroorooda; aba gideaba gising'waar was deaweeda gaygwanuus, nea Guroorooda gagoona eaweega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa deaweedeeda miyeeda, iissa ghafunya geaw jeeda barawajeega lagheanga, ghwaan nea gweadu giigheambiita ak abeeda ea mang'ula fuga Israeli gheamamda Musa aba gidameang'meang'da, amadu ghwasuunya aba giduurji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda deaweedeeda Guroorooda ea majeefurda ak ea majeadeapta aba giigheambiita hawi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iimida giigheambiita jeeda deaweeda jea gweadu girgweaksiinda, abeeda deaweedeeda doobiiwnata gagasa ghang'ata aba giigheambiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu, gidaghayi mideawa giigheambiita ea mudugwandeawa giigheambiita earahay, nea gweagu giigheambiitida adaraamiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gidida suunyaan iyeadu giigheambiita, abeeda gida jea ghwashng'u gaygwandeawa giigheambiita haw muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iinukwa geandeawi rarooda, ng'asheanda uurjunu, ada abeeda geawooschi muranga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea meewuurjeewani Musaheeda ghayi dukuta gheamamdaanyi ak abeeda ea mwadaaha muuchi fuga Israeli mudeanoodeaba giigheambiitida suunyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fugheerga nyaawa geanung' gahang'oonyiidi; aba gideaba eara askweareani damanda siisoamwana neajeedeaba garayi, gili siikwealiisa uhuudean gudugwanda heeda, geaghus eegeanda iiguuyi siida sea Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea, eara askweareani iisiissoamwa deaweedeeda Musa geedukuta fugheerga nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida iiyamsa geaw Ng'utamiida hean geegeanda gidida awiimiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa Ng'utamiida Guroorooda, nea heeda mida Guroorooda Ng'utamiida, gwanda giibaldeaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aseasa eesa sean, aba gheamamda meedukuta, ng'ula giigheambiita Ng'utamiida, siyam gawuurji sea niny ghang'eada giigheambiita ea gagul giigheambiita; aba gideaba ng'asheanji gwaleabu heeda Ng'utamiida was Guroorooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
